Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.08,0:01:13.55,OP - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,420)\blur5}我想 你会就这么沉默着
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.55,0:01:19.26,OP - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(420,334)\blur5}如夏日的风一般远去
