Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.14,0:01:27.60,OP - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur5}却要道一声别
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.10,0:01:31.23,OP - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,120)\blur5}我闪闪发光
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.32,0:01:34.24,OP - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur5}抬起头看看吧
