Dialogue: 3,0:21:54.25,0:22:00.31,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}我能就像现在这样吗
Dialogue: 3,0:22:00.31,0:22:01.90,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}好想被爱
Dialogue: 3,0:22:01.90,0:22:08.31,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}哪怕抛下我所熟悉的世界
Dialogue: 3,0:22:08.73,0:22:11.99,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}从未和他人拼凑在一起
Dialogue: 3,0:22:11.99,0:22:14.80,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}诉说着话语  却无法沟通
Dialogue: 3,0:22:14.80,0:22:17.54,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}无法融入这世界的「理所当然」
Dialogue: 3,0:22:17.54,0:22:19.77,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}也找不到归处
Dialogue: 3,0:22:20.03,0:22:23.24,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}没有人和我同甘共苦
Dialogue: 3,0:22:23.24,0:22:25.87,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}总是顾及别人的视线
Dialogue: 3,0:22:25.87,0:22:28.69,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}不停地  不停地
Dialogue: 3,0:22:28.69,0:22:31.19,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}在自己身上涂改
Dialogue: 3,0:22:31.19,0:22:34.32,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}将自己的名字刻在心里
Dialogue: 3,0:22:34.32,0:22:38.30,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}将那个不能做自己的我
Dialogue: 3,0:22:39.50,0:22:44.55,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}留在过去
Dialogue: 3,0:22:48.60,0:22:54.52,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)}我要做我自己
Dialogue: 3,0:22:54.52,0:22:56.73,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)}跨越每一片大海  自由地奔跑
Dialogue: 3,0:22:56.73,0:22:59.97,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)}离开这逼仄的世界
Dialogue: 3,0:22:59.97,0:23:05.78,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)}渴求着爱而颤抖着的心
Dialogue: 3,0:23:06.19,0:23:10.28,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)}将因照耀着明日的你
Dialogue: 3,0:23:10.75,0:23:13.13,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)}而熠熠生辉
Dialogue: 3,0:23:16.07,0:23:24.43,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,0)}我也一定会是某个人的光
Dialogue: 2,0:21:54.25,0:22:00.31,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}私は私のままで良いかな？
Dialogue: 2,0:22:00.31,0:22:01.90,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}愛されたい
Dialogue: 2,0:22:01.90,0:22:08.31,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}自分の知る世界を手放しても
Dialogue: 2,0:22:08.73,0:22:11.99,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}ほかの人と we never pieced together
Dialogue: 2,0:22:11.99,0:22:14.80,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}伝えても通じ合えない
Dialogue: 2,0:22:14.80,0:22:17.54,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}「普通」に馴染めなくて
Dialogue: 2,0:22:17.54,0:22:19.77,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}居場所さえない
Dialogue: 2,0:22:20.03,0:22:23.24,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}分かち合う人いなくて
Dialogue: 2,0:22:23.24,0:22:25.87,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}視線ばかり気にして
Dialogue: 2,0:22:25.87,0:22:28.69,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}ずっとずっと自分を
Dialogue: 2,0:22:28.69,0:22:31.19,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}書き換えていた
Dialogue: 2,0:22:31.19,0:22:34.32,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I write my name　刻んで
Dialogue: 2,0:22:34.32,0:22:38.30,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}ありのままじゃない自分を
Dialogue: 2,0:22:39.50,0:22:44.55,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}もう過去に置いてく
Dialogue: 2,0:22:48.60,0:22:54.52,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)}私は私のままでいたい
Dialogue: 2,0:22:54.52,0:22:56.73,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)}Crossing every sea, running free
Dialogue: 2,0:22:56.73,0:22:59.97,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)}狭い世界離れて
Dialogue: 2,0:22:59.97,0:23:05.78,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)}愛されたくて　ふるえる心は
Dialogue: 2,0:23:06.19,0:23:10.28,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)}明日を照らす君だけの
Dialogue: 2,0:23:10.75,0:23:13.13,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)}it's your wild glow
Dialogue: 2,0:23:16.07,0:23:24.43,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,0)}きっと誰かの光だから
